  "name": null,
  "problem": "Sarah conducts an experiment $40$ times to see how quickly a machine sorts a bin of parts. The table below shows the results of her experiments.\n\n| Time (seconds) | Frequency |\n| --- | --- |\n| $<20$ | $6$ |\n| $20-30$ | $16$ |\n| $30-40$ | $10$ |\n| $40-50$ | $5$ |\n| $>50$ | $3$ |\n\nBased on the experimental probabilities of these results, complete the following statements.\n\n$\\,$A machine sorting a bin of parts in less than $30$ seconds is\n{{field-1}}.\n\n$\\,$A machine sorting a bin of parts in more than $30$ seconds is\n{{field-2}}.\n\n$\\,$A machine sorting a bin of parts in less than $30$ seconds is\n{{field-3}}\na machine sorting a bin of parts in more than $30$ seconds.",
